  "privacy": {
    "title": "🔒 Your privacy",
    "paragraphs": {
      "0": "<strong>All your data</strong> (tasks, dates, locations, and photos) is stored only on this device and browser, and is never sent to any server.",
      "1": "<strong>The map</strong> is just an online image and uploads nothing about you. Map services (OpenStreetMap, Esri) only receive image tiles, not your task data.",
      "2": "<strong>Time sync</strong> with public servers (timeapi.io, worldclockapi.com) is only for correcting the device clock and sends no information.",
      "3": "<strong>Weather forecast</strong> is fetched from Open-Meteo and only sends the location coordinates and date. No task data is sent.",
      "4": "<strong>Place name</strong> is fetched from Nominatim (OpenStreetMap); only coordinates are sent, and a city name is returned.",
      "5": "<strong>Telegram login</strong> is only for optional sync. If you don't sign in, no data is sent to the server.",
      "6": "<strong>Backup:</strong> the \"📤 Backup\" button in settings lets you create a JSON file.",
      "7": "To fully erase your data, use the trash, or clear the site data from your browser settings."
    },
    "buttonText": "Got it"
